      "path": "src/ui/cockpit/track.tsx",
      "content": "The enclosing `.track` has `role=\"img\"`, which makes its descendants presentational in the accessibility tree. Consequently these nested images' labels are not exposed reliably to screen readers, and the parent's accessible name does not include the lot labels. This fails A237's requirement that each tick be named. Use a container role that permits accessible children (and preserve the track's name), or expose the individually named ticks outside the image container.",
